  "_classes_agropest12": "PLACEHOLDER - to confirm with IIHR mentor. The 12 classes of the AgroPest-12 YOLOv8s model (inference-service/, used for phone and Telegram photos). category: pest = counts toward the action threshold; predator = natural enemy (counts toward the pests-per-predator ratio); beneficial = shown but counted as neither (bees pollinate, earthworms help the soil). Kannada names need a native-speaker review.",
  "_classes_pest29": "PLACEHOLDER - EXPERIMENTAL model, to confirm with IIHR mentor. The 29 classes of the YOLO11s pest model (fine-tuned on \"pests-hf\", 2026-11-04; mAP@50 0.25 on its own validation set) served by inference-service/ for phone and Telegram photos while the AgroPest-12 weights are unavailable. category neutral = not a crop pest (counted as neither pest nor predator). Kannada names need a native-speaker review; several keep the scientific name.",
